<%# One stacked fraction. Shared so a widget answer and a question body never
    show the same value in two different notations. The two numbers are drawn
    for the eye and hidden from a screen reader, which is given „3/4" whole —
    read as two loose numbers, ¾ was „3 4". Same markup in
    RichContent.render_math, lib/frac.js and lib/authoring.js. %>
<span class="frac" role="math" aria-label="<%= numerator %>/<%= denominator %>"><span aria-hidden="true"><%= numerator %></span><span aria-hidden="true"><%= denominator %></span></span>